  "validityScope": "Hazus 6.1 class HWB4 only; the Table 7-1 rows that select it are under parameters.classification_rules. Earthquake fragility for Sa(1.0 s) or PGD, reproduced from the user-supplied Hazus 6.1 specification (Tables 7-1, 7-2, 7-6, 7-7). Supplies BASE shaking curves only: the Table 7-2 K3D equation divides by N - 1, which is zero for a single-span bridge, so the modified curve is refused rather than repaired. Crossed thresholds and source formula singularities are errors. PGD requires an explicit interpretation policy. US/NBI classification or a named project mapping. No deterioration/AssetHealth dependence, multi-asset joint draws, restoration, or damage-to-capacity mapping.",
